CREATE (:`DatabaseObject`:`Summation` {`dbId`: 9613563, `displayName`: "Once phosphorylated, PLINs are believed to dissociate from P...", `schemaClass`: "Summation", `text`: "Once phosphorylated, PLINs are believed to dissociate from PRKAA2 and translocate to the cytosol (S Kaushik et al. 2015, S Kaushik et al. 2016). The precise dissociation mechanism of Plins is unclear. The experiments showing this finding were performed in mouse models."});
